    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>A <em>Mechanical Wonder</em> is a semi-autonomous object filled with magical power. Wonders come in many sizes and shapes, depending on what they were built to do.</p><p>A wonder lies dormant until it is activated. To activate it, you wind it with the handheld key made for that wonder alone. Winding takes 1 minute, during which you must take the Utilize action on each of your turns. Once wound, the wonder stays active for the duration given in its description.</p><p><strong>Mobility Wonder.</strong> While inactive, this wonder looks like a metal turtle shell fitted with straps, made to be worn on your back or flank depending on your anatomy. Once wound, it turns into a personal transport device and stays active for 24 hours. While it’s active, your Speed becomes 30 feet, and other creatures can’t remove the wonder from you unless you allow it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-PSXMkAtyAdfHCOFP\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Wonder équipé, l’activité <em>Wind</em> active ou désactive son effet (Vitesse de 30 pieds) ; désactivez-le au bout de 24 heures.</p></section>",
